// Port of the historic ex000001.bin («Почти компилятор, интерпретатор»,
// the Test-PostMachine v5.0 era, 2005): unary increment — "прибавление к
// числу одного" per the tree's own info.txt. Hand-decoded from the
// 32-bit-word image ((n<<24)|(cmd<<16)|(par1<<8)|par2, little-endian on
// disk); the numbered-instruction/explicit-successor shape below IS the
// original's, 1:1 (its `right(0)` — successor 0 = stop — becomes
// `right(!)`). Every add fires on a cell just proven blank and every
// unmark on one proven marked, so the run is clean under the era's
// strict semantics too. The historic executor's belt was bounded on the
// left (stepping left of cell 1 ended the run); the infinite tape
// reproduces the historic behavior for a number placed away from the
// belt edge.
main() {
 1: right(2);
 2: check(1, 3);
 3: mark(4);
 4: left(5);
 5: check(4, 6);
 6: right(!);
}
